Upstream-Name: imp72
Source: https://github.com/moebiusV/imp72
Comment: The files of the original IMP72 compiler (decus/) and pcc
 (third_party/pcc, of which only the pass 2 compiler cc1 is built) keep their
 own terms.  The summary of the many notices in pcc is in
 /usr/share/doc/imp72/LICENSE.pcc.md and the provenance of the DECUS files in
 /usr/share/doc/imp72/PROVENANCE.decus.md.

